ved today.", "title": "That was nice"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s adventure.", "title": "Time to head home 🏠"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on today''s moments.", "title": "Hope you''ll come back soon ❤️"}, {"body": "Tap to share {{child_name}}''s standout moments.", "title": "Thank you for being here"}, {"body": "Tap to capture what shone today for {{child_name}}.", "title": "A lovely afternoon"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on the moments and claim the full pool.", "title": "{{child_name}} earned XP today"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s play session.", "title": "Wrap up time 🎈"}, {"body": "Tap to capture {{child_name}}''s best bits.", "title": "Hope it was a good one"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on today and earn XP for {{child_name}}.", "title": "See you again soon"}, {"body": "Tap to add {{child_name}}''s moments.", "title": "Today''s done, the diary lives on"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect and earn XP.", "title": "Hope {{child_name}} loved it"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s session.", "title": "Thanks for letting us host you"}, {"body": "Tap to capture today''s moments for {{child_name}}.", "title": "That was special"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s time today.", "title": "Take home a happy heart"}, {"body": "Tap to mark what stood out for {{child_name}}.", "title": "All wrapped up"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s session.", "title": "Hope you had a fab time 🌟"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s play and earn full XP.", "title": "Thank you ❤️"}, {"body": "Tap to capture today''s highlights.", "title": "Until tomorrow"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on {{child_name}}''s adventure.", "title": "That was lovely"}, {"body": "Tap to add {{child_name}}''s moments and earn XP.", "title": "Diary entry awaits 📔"}, {"body": "Tap to mark today''s best moments.", "title": "Hope it was a fun one"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect on what {{child_name}} loved.", "title": "Thanks for the visit"}, {"body": "Tap to capture {{child_name}}''s session.", "title": "Have a lovely evening 🌙"}, {"body": "Tap to mark {{child_name}}''s favourite moments.", "title": "Take home a story"}, {"body": "Tap to reflect and earn XP for {{child_name}}.", "title": "Beautiful session today"}]'::jsonb,1800) ON CONFLICT (type) DO UPDATE SET category=EXCLUDED.category,enabled=EXCLUDED.enabled,title=EXCLUDED.title,body=EXCLUDED.body,deep_link_template=EXCLUDED.deep_link_template,timing_offset_minutes=EXCLUDED.timing_offset_minutes,variables=EXCLUDED.variables,preference_key=EXCLUDED.preference_key,description=EXCLUDED.description,variants=EXCLUDED.variants,ttl_seconds=EXCLUDED.ttl_seconds;
INSERT INTO public.notification_templates (type,category,enabled,title,body,deep_link_template,timing_offset_minutes,variables,preference_key,description,variants,ttl_seconds) VALUES ('session_started','session','t','Welcome, {{child_name}} 🎈','Your play time is on. Wishing you a brilliant adventure together.','/home',NULL,'["child_name", "session_id"]'::jsonb,'session_reminders','Fires when staff scans the customer QR and the session flips from pending to active.','[{"body": "Your play time is on. Wishing you a brilliant adventure together.", "title": "Welcome, {{child_name}} 🎈"}, {"body": "An hour of slides, and play — make it a brilliant one.", "title": "{{child_name}}, your adventure starts now ✨"}, {"body": "Rafi, Ellie, Gerry and Zena are excited to play with you today.", "title": "Hi there, {{child_name}}!"}, {"body": "A whole hour of cushions, slides, and stories ahead.", "title": "Let''s go, {{child_name}} 🚀"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}''s session is live. Enjoy every minute.", "title": "Welcome to Play Diaries 🎨"}, {"body": "Try the slide first — Rafi the lion would.", "title": "Have fun, {{child_name}} 🦁"}, {"body": "Ellie says: notice who else is playing alone today, and say hi.", "title": "Hi {{child_name}} 🐘"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, the play floor is yours for the next hour.", "title": "Adventure mode on 🚀"}, {"body": "Time to play, build, climb, & create — all of it.", "title": "{{child_name}} is in the building 🎉"}, {"body": "We''ve been waiting. Have a brilliant session today.", "title": "Welcome back, {{child_name}} ❤️"}, {"body": "Gerry the giraffe says: keep asking why.", "title": "Off you go, {{child_name}} 🌟"}, {"body": "Zena the chameleon is curious what you''ll create today.", "title": "Hi {{child_name}} 🦊"}, {"body": "Have a wonderful hour, {{child_name}}.", "title": "Play floor, all yours 🎈"}, {"body": "An hour of slides, play and snacks awaits.", "title": "{{child_name}}, ready to play"}, {"body": "We hope today''s full of brave moments and kind ones too.", "title": "Welcome in, {{child_name}}"}, {"body": "One hour of pure play starts now.", "title": "It''s go time, {{child_name}} 🎉"}, {"body": "The cars, the slides — all set up for you.", "title": "{{child_name}} just got in 🎨"}, {"body": "Hope today brings a few brilliant memories.", "title": "Hi {{child_name}} 🎀"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, the ball bit is calling.", "title": "Welcome, brave one 🦁"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, see who needs a friend today.", "title": "Welcome, kind one 🐘"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, what''ll you discover this hour?", "title": "Welcome, curious one 🦒"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, three cushions can become a castle.", "title": "Welcome, creative one 🦊"}, {"body": "Have a wonderful time, {{child_name}}.", "title": "One hour, all play 🎈"}, {"body": "Run, climb, & build — make it a brilliant one.", "title": "{{child_name}}, your time starts now"}, {"body": "Today''s a great day for an adventure.", "title": "Hey {{child_name}} ✨"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, see what you discover today.", "title": "Welcome, little explorer 🌟"}, {"body": "Hope today''s full of laughter and surprise.", "title": "{{child_name}} just walked in"}, {"body": "Rafi the lion is already at the slide.", "title": "Off we go, {{child_name}} 🚀"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, the play floor is all set up for you.", "title": "Welcome, friend 🎈"}, {"body": "One hour of slides, stories, and a little snack break in between.", "title": "It''s playtime, {{child_name}}"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, today''s chapter is yours to write.", "title": "Welcome to the diaries 📔"}, {"body": "Hope today brings you stories worth telling.", "title": "Big welcome, {{child_name}} 🤗"}, {"body": "An hour of pure play, no rush.", "title": "{{child_name}}''s in!"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, today''s pages are blank — fill them.", "title": "Welcome, story-maker 🎨"}, {"body": "Wishing you an hour of brave and curious moments.", "title": "Hi {{child_name}} 🌈"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, the place is yours.", "title": "Welcome in, friend ❤️"}, {"body": "An hour of play, with the four heroes cheering you on.", "title": "{{child_name}}, it''s time 🎉"}, {"body": "{{child_name}}, take the first step.", "title": "Today''s adventure starts here"}, {"body": "Glad you''re here. Let''s make it a brilliant hour.", "title": "Hey there, {{child_name}} 👋"}, {"body": "Your time at Play Diaries begins now.", "title": "Welcome aboard, {{child_name}} 🎈"}]'::jsonb,300) ON CONFLICT (type) DO UPDATE SET category=EXCLUDED.category,enabled=EXCLUDED.enabled,title=EXCLUDED.title,body=EXCLUDED.body,deep_link_template=EXCLUDED.deep_link_template,timing_offset_minutes=EXCLUDED.timing_offset_minutes,variables=EXCLUDED.variables,preference_key=EXCLUDED.preference_key,description=EXCLUDED.description,variants=EXCLUDED.variants,ttl_seconds=EXCLUDED.ttl_seconds;
